title: Sharing and joining say what they open up and ask first; Cancel shares nothing, an invitation that is not one never gets to the question
folders: share-text
limit: 60
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
forbid-log: WARN.*script
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share offer
wait 800
mark a-asks-before-sharing
wait 400
answer Cancel
wait 800
mark b-cancelled-nothing-shared
wait 400
share offer
wait 600
answer Share
wait 1500
mark c-sharing-the-panel-with-the-invitation
wait 22000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share enter not-an-invitation
wait 800
mark d-not-an-invitation-no-question
wait 400
share enter {INVITE}
wait 800
mark e-asks-before-joining
wait 400
answer Join
wait 5000
fit
wait 1200
mark f-joined
wait 1000
quit
wait 1500
